    {
      "duration_ms": 12000,
      "caption": "Terms are a logical clock: at most one leader per term, and stale terms are rejected.",
      "narration": "Time is split into numbered terms, a logical clock, with at most one leader each. Every RPC carries a term; a server seeing a larger one adopts it.",
      "elements": [
        {
